# This BR2_EXTERNAL tree defines no extra Kconfig options.
#
# It carries only board files and a rootfs overlay: the Rust binaries
# (florestad, floresta-cli, floresta-microbench) are cross-compiled by Nix — see
# images/rasp-pi-zero/patches.nix — and injected into the image through a second
# rootfs overlay directory, so Buildroot never needs a Rust toolchain.
# That keeps the Buildroot side small and lets the Nix side reuse the
# same floresta-build.nix machinery the Android targets use.
